  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000s1ln](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000s1ln) Magnitude 6.1 earthquake at 26.162 depth occurred on Mar 03 2026 55km W of Kampong Haloban. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 2.0344 longitude 96.7729. It impacted 3164 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
